# Git attributes configuration
# Model files are tracked using DVC (not Git LFS)
# See: https://dvc.org/doc

# Text file handling
*.py text=auto
*.md text=auto
*.yml text=auto
*.yaml text=auto
*.txt text=auto
*.json text=auto

# Binary files
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary

# Note: Large model files (*.pt, *.pth, *.h5, etc.) are tracked by DVC
# They are NOT stored in Git/LFS. Use `dvc pull` to download them.



